cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "spinodal: CALPHAD spinodal decomposition analysis via Jansson chemical Hessian"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ichasekatz/spinodal"
# TODO: replace with actual Zenodo DOI after first release
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"
abstract: >
  Analytical CALPHAD spinodal decomposition analysis using the Jansson chemical Hessian.
  Computes H[i,j] = d(mu_i - mu_dep)/dx_j via pycalphad's fixed_component_differential,
  performs gauge-invariant eigenanalysis in composition simplex space, and maps
  spinodal boundaries in binary and multicomponent alloy systems.
authors:
